'''Ultimate Wildmutt''' is the [[Ultimatrix]]'s artificially [[Ultimate Forms|evolved]] DNA sample of a [[Vulpimancer (Classic)|Vulpimancer]].

==Appearance==
Ultimate Wildmutt is significantly larger and more muscular than Wildmutt. His fur is a crimson color and he has huge gray/white spikes running down his back that overlap. These spikes start out as a shark-like fin at the head and rises almost into an arc over the back, tapering near the rump. He also has a long tail with a curved horned tip, resembling a scorpion stinger. His lips are black, like Wildmutt in the '''Original Series''', and he has white claws.

Ultimate Wildmutt wears the evolved [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

==Powers and Abilities==
<gallery type="slideshow" position="right">
File:PN775IM (446).png|Sharp Teeth
File:PN775IM (455).png|Sharp Claws
File:PN775IM (450).png|Spiked Tail/Enhanced Strength
File:TUE2 (151).png|Enhanced Bite Force
File:PN775IM (434).png|Bipedalism
</gallery>
Unlike his [[Wildmutt|devolved form]], Ultimate Wildmutt has the ability to speak other languages than the Vulpimancer language.<ref name="PN775IM">''[[Prisoner Number 775 is Missing]]''</ref>

Ultimate Wildmutt retains Wildmutt's incredible senses of smell and hearing.

Ultimate Wildmutt has sharp claws and teeth, which can be used for close range combat. He also has a scorpion-like tail with a sharp tip.{{Refn|''[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: The Wild Truth]]''; [[:File:TWT Ultimate Wildmutt Data.png|file]]|group = DVD}}

Ultimate Wildmutt possesses enhanced strength, as he was easily able to hold down [[Prisoner 775]].<ref name="PN775IM" />

Ultimate Wildmutt possesses an enhanced bite force, as he was easily able to lift and twist an [[Esoterica]] in the air while biting it using only his jaws.<ref>''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]''</ref>

==History==
