*Ultimate Wildmutt first appeared in ''[[Prisoner Number 775 is Missing]]'', where he defeated [[Prisoner 775]].
*In ''[[The Ultimate Enemy: Part 2]]'', Ultimate Wildmutt defeated the [[Esoterica]].

